  "solution": {
    "text": "Given : <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> ... (1)<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> ... (2)<br /><br />Subtracting (1) from (2)<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Also, <math><mi>T</mi></math> is positive therefore period of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></math>"
